    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Brady are delighted to be selling this impressive two storey farmhouse with selection of outbuildings on circa 2 acres of land in Eslin close to Mohill. Enjoying a great location with superb views of surrounding countryside this property is accessed via double gates and short concrete driveway and concrete surrounds to the house. The land surrounds the house and is ideal for those looking to do some gardening or becoming more self sufficient and also room for a pony or two if needed! There are a selection of outbuildings with the house so lots of external storage space with gardens to the front and side. The property is a well laid out house with sittingroom, living room, kitchen, shower room, bathroom, rear hallway and 3 no. bedrooms one of which is a single bedroom and 2 no. double bedrooms. THe house has been improved over the years and has been rewired, heating installed, external concrete done around the property and new windows were installed. The house quailifies for the vacant property grant scheme (subject to conditions). The house is close to Mohill with all its many amenities including national and secondary schools, childcare facilities, shops, places to eat and there is a train station in nearby Dromod village and its a 10 minute drive to the nearby N4 main route to Dublin/Sligo. Carrick on Shannon is also approx 15 min drive away. If you dream of living in a rural picturesque location surrounded by scenic views with a couple of acres around you and a great selection of outbuildings then this may be the place for you. Contact Celia in REA Brady on 071 9622444 to organise a viewing of this great property or email celia@reabrady.ie. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance\n2.28m x 1.17m Entrance hallway with door to living room, alarm\n\nLiving Room\n4.37m x 4.01m Living room wth solid fuel range, stairs to first floor, tv and power points, tiled flooring stars leading to first floor, window to front of house, door through to shower room, door through to kitchen at the rear.\n\nKitchen\n3.66m x 1.98m Kitchen with window to rear, tiled fooring, tiled over counter top, single drainer sink, shelving for storage, storage cupboard, power points, door to living room and opening through to rear hallway and then to downstairs bathroom.\n\nSitting Room\n3.92m x 3.30m Sittingroom with wooden flooring, open fireplace with tiled surround, window to the front and to the side with deep windowsill, power points and tv point\n\nBedroom 1\n4.79m x 1.91m Single bedroom on the first floor, laminated flooring, window to front, power points\n\nBedroom 2\n3.69m x 3.31m Double bedroom with laminated flooring, window to the rear, power points and radiator.\n\nBedroom 3\n4.48m x 3.22m Double bedroom with laminated flooring, wallpaper on walls, window to front, power points, radiator.\n\nShower Room\n2.78m x 1.76m Large Shower room off the living area, walk in shower, whb, wc, window to front\n\nBathroom\n2.78m x 1.77m Bathroom with bath, whb, wc, window, tiling on floor, window, fan heater\n\nRear Hallway\n2.85m x 1.46m Rear hallway also used as a utility area, plumbed for washing machine, storage space and power points, door to bathroom.\n\nLanding\n Landing area wth laminated flooring, window to front, radiator.\n\n\nOutside\nSelection of outbuildings Concrete driveway and parking Gardens to front and side"
      },
